  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor#PINF> .

<https://w3id.org/fair-genomes/ontology/Individual_consent_Collected_by_Un-encoded_(UNC,_nullflavor)>
