  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor#UNK> .

<https://w3id.org/fair-genomes/ontology/Individual_consent_Collected_by_Asked_but_unknown_(ASKU,_nullflavor)>
  a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000688>;
